dataset: official_futures_daily
rules:
- id: official_futures_daily-input-v1
  input_id: ASTOCK-071
  provider: exchange_composite
  endpoint: futures_daily
  field_mapping:
    trade_date: date
    exchange: exchange
    contract_code: symbol
    product: product
    open: open
    high: high
    low: low
    close: close
    settle: settle
    pre_settle: pre_settle
    volume: volume
    open_interest: open_interest
    oi_change: oi_change
    turnover_10k: turnover_10k
  context_fields:
    snapshot_at: source_snapshot_at
  null_values:
  - null
  - ''
  unverified_fields:
  - open
  - high
  - low
  - close
  - settle
  - pre_settle
  - volume
  - open_interest
  - oi_change
  - turnover_10k
  status: pending_validation
  version: remaining-original-input-v1
  evidence_refs:
  - ASTOCK-071
  notes: 保留原独立接口及原解析。原数字单独留证，标准数字单位未认证；无来源或日期回退，生产关闭。
